   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSOs with increased Lobby and Advocacy capacities</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">During year 1 of CSF2 we have conducted advocacy training to 20 (out of 22) grantees and also issued an Advocacy Manual to these organisations, which was developed under CSF1. However, for only 17 of the trained organisations we can demonstrate an improvement in their ability to lobby and campaign as 3 organisations were recently contracted and we are yet to see evidence that the training translated into improved advocacy capacity.</narrative>
    </description>
